[[FSE STAGE type=proscenium width=10 depth=8 units=m]]
[[FSE ENTITY door type=entrance pos=5,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY sam type=cast pos=0,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY alex type=cast pos=-3,2]]
[[FSE ENTITY chair type=prop pos=-3,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY table type=prop pos=3,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY skull type=prop with=alex]]
[[FSE ENTITY lamp type=prop]]

INT. BATHROOM

[[FSE MOVE sam pos=chair facing=chair]]

She goes to the chair.

[[FSE MOVE chair pos=table by=crew]]

It's taken to the table.

[[FSE MOVE sam pos=skull]]

She goes after the skull Alex holds.

[[FSE ENTER lamp from=door pos=table]]

A lamp is brought to the table.
